type: software
title: "k11 Integration QA MCP Server"
abstract: "MCP server and CI tool for integration testing of event-driven and batch systems as release evidence: flows that combine API calls, Apache Kafka messages (publish, expect with JSON-path matching and time limits, dead-letter queues, AsyncAPI payload checks), batch jobs and database checks, with guardrails that keep publishing and jobs on test environments."
